    (ΛW : Submodule (𝓞 D.host.E) (Fin WW.rank → D.host.E)), IsSelfDualC A ΛA → IsSelfDualC A' ΛA' → IsSelfDualC WW ΛW →
    p ≤ pp D j → q ≤ qq D j → A.rank + 2 * pp D j = rankV D (i + 1) (j + 1) + 2 * p →
